# Temporal.Instant (docs/temporal.md), UTC only. Every expected value was
# generated by temporal-polyfill 1.0.5 (the vendored
# tests/vendor/temporal-polyfill, which diff-node runs as Temporal) and is
# the same in @js-temporal/polyfill 0.5.1. A RangeError or a TypeError
# there is a fault here. A case named "deliberate" faults where JavaScript
# gives a value: a conversion of a string, an array or an object, identity,
# locale data, a time zone other than UTC or a fixed offset, a
# ZonedDateTime, which staticjs does not have, or a case on which the two
# polyfills give different values. temporal_test sweeps the strings,
# round's units, increments and modes, toString's digits and time zones,
# and until's and since's units further (diff-node compares its lines too).

# --- The constructor and the epoch functions

=== new Temporal.Instant
new Temporal.Instant(1704067200123456789n)
--- value
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00:00.123456789Z")

=== before the epoch
new Temporal.Instant(-1n)
--- value
Temporal.Instant.from("1969-12-31T23:59:59.999999999Z")

=== at the limits
[new Temporal.Instant(8640000000000000000000n), new Temporal.Instant(-8640000000000000000000n)]
--- value
[Temporal.Instant.from("+275760-09-13T00:00:00Z"),Temporal.Instant.from("-271821-04-20T00:00:00Z")]

=== past the limits
new Temporal.Instant(8640000000000000000001n)
--- fault 8.64 x 10^21

=== past the limits below
new Temporal.Instant(-8640000000000000000001n)
--- fault 8.64 x 10^21

=== far past the limits
new Temporal.Instant(2n ** 200n)
--- fault 8.64 x 10^21

=== booleans convert
[new Temporal.Instant(true), new Temporal.Instant(false)]
--- value
[Temporal.Instant.from("1970-01-01T00:00:00.000000001Z"),Temporal.Instant.from("1970-01-01T00:00:00Z")]

=== a number
new Temporal.Instant(1)
--- fault not a BigInt

=== no argument
new Temporal.Instant()
--- fault not a BigInt

=== null
new Temporal.Instant(null)
--- fault not a BigInt

=== a string, deliberate
new Temporal.Instant("123")
--- fault would convert

=== an array, deliberate
new Temporal.Instant([1])
--- fault would convert

