[Temporal.Instant.fromEpochMilliseconds(1704067200123), Temporal.Instant.fromEpochMilliseconds(-1), Temporal.Instant.fromEpochMilliseconds(-0)]
--- value
[Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00:00.123Z"),Temporal.Instant.from("1969-12-31T23:59:59.999Z"),Temporal.Instant.from("1970-01-01T00:00:00Z")]

=== fromEpochMilliseconds at the limits
[Temporal.Instant.fromEpochMilliseconds(8.64e15), Temporal.Instant.fromEpochMilliseconds(-8.64e15)]
