# --- from

=== from a string with Z
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00Z")
--- value
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00:00Z")

=== from a string with an offset
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00+01:00")
--- value
Temporal.Instant.from("2023-12-31T23:00:00Z")

=== an offset with seconds and a fraction, applied exactly
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00+01:00:30.5")
--- value
Temporal.Instant.from("2023-12-31T22:59:29.5Z")

=== an offset's basic and short forms
[Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00+0100"), Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00-01"), Temporal.Instant.from("20240101T000000-0130")]
--- value
[Temporal.Instant.from("2023-12-31T23:00:00Z"),Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T01:00:00Z"),Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T01:30:00Z")]

=== the greatest offset
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00-23:59:59.999999999")
--- value
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T23:59:59.999999999Z")

=== an offset of 24 hours
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00+24:00")
--- fault not one

=== an offset's seconds of 60, deliberate: the polyfills differ
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00+01:00:60")
--- fault not one

=== an offset's separators mixed: the polyfills differ
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00+01:0030")
--- fault not one

=== lowercase z and t, and a space
[Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01t00:00z"), Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01 12:30:45.5Z")]
--- value
[Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"),Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T12:30:45.5Z")]

=== an hour alone, and a comma
[Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T12Z"), Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00:00,5Z")]
--- value
[Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T12:00:00Z"),Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00:00.5Z")]

=== a leap second is the second before
Temporal.Instant.from("2016-12-31T23:59:60Z")
--- value
Temporal.Instant.from("2016-12-31T23:59:59Z")

=== without an offset
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00")
--- fault not one

=== a date alone
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01")
--- fault not one

=== a date with Z and no time
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01Z")
--- fault not one

=== annotations are read and ignored
[Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00Z[UTC]"), Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00+01:00[Europe/Paris]"), Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00+01:00[-05:00]")]
--- value
[Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"),Temporal.Instant.from("2023-12-31T23:00:00Z"),Temporal.Instant.from("2023-12-31T23:00:00Z")]

=== a calendar annotation is ignored, any calendar
[Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00Z[u-ca=hebrew]"), Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00Z[!u-ca=iso8601]"), Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00Z[u-ca=hebrew][u-ca=gregory]")]
--- value
[Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"),Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"),Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00:00Z")]

=== a critical unknown annotation
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00Z[!foo=bar]")
--- fault not one

=== two calendars, one critical
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00Z[!u-ca=hebrew][u-ca=gregory]")
--- fault not one

=== two time zones
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00Z[UTC][UTC]")
--- fault not one

=== a time zone after a calendar, deliberate: the polyfills differ
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00Z[u-ca=iso8601][UTC]")
--- fault not one

=== an empty annotation, deliberate: the polyfills differ
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00Z[]")
--- fault not one

=== ten fraction digits
Temporal.Instant.from("2024-01-01T00:00:00.1234567891Z")
--- fault not one

=== at the limits through an offset
[Temporal.Instant.from("+275760-09-13T01:00+01:00"), Temporal.Instant.from("-271821-04-19T23:00-01:00"), Temporal.Instant.from("+275760-09-13T23:59+23:59")]
--- value
[Temporal.Instant.from("+275760-09-13T00:00:00Z"),Temporal.Instant.from("-271821-04-20T00:00:00Z"),Temporal.Instant.from("+275760-09-13T00:00:00Z")]

=== a nanosecond past the greatest
Temporal.Instant.from("+275760-09-13T00:00:00.000000001Z")
--- fault 8.64 x 10^21

=== a nanosecond before the least
Temporal.Instant.from("-271821-04-19T23:59:59.999999999Z")
--- fault 8.64 x 10^21

=== year -0
Temporal.Instant.from("-000000-01-01T00:00Z")
--- fault not one

=== from an Instant
Temporal.Instant.from(new Temporal.Instant(5n))
--- value
Temporal.Instant.from("1970-01-01T00:00:00.000000005Z")

=== from a number
Temporal.Instant.from(5)
--- fault neither an Instant nor a string

=== from a PlainDateTime
